...@_theme
direction: right

A: "Base-image AIMModel\nspec.image: aim-base:0.11" {class: user}
B: "Base AIMProfiles\nrole=base\nstatus.deployable=false" {class: managed}
C: "Custom-model AIMModel\nspec.profiles.derivedFrom..." {class: user}
D: "Deployable AIMProfiles\nrole=deployable\nstatus.deployable=true" {class: managed}
E: "AIMService\nspec.model.name: ..." {class: resolved}

A -> B: emits base profiles
B -> C: consumed by
C -> D: emits deployable profiles
D -> E: backs
